  "description": "Ask questions about your documents, databases, images and audio in natural language. Multi-database RAG library for .NET that queries SQL Server, MySQL, PostgreSQL, SQLite together with AI. On-premise ready with Ollama, Whisper.net. GDPR/KVKK/HIPAA compliant. Compatible with .NET 6+. Includes built-in Dashboard for document management and chat.",
